flowchart LR
  Dev[Developer or CI] --> Launch[rai run]
  Launch --> Detect[Detect or receive harness]
  Detect --> Locate[Locate .rosettai manifest]
  Locate --> Validate[Validate canonical model]
  Validate --> Resolve[Resolve profiles, overlays and secrets refs]
  Resolve --> Adapter{Target adapter}
  Adapter --> Claude[Claude Code projection]
  Adapter --> OpenCode[OpenCode projection]
  Adapter --> Copilot[GitHub Copilot projection]
  Claude --> Cache[Content-addressed local runtime cache]
  OpenCode --> Cache
  Copilot --> Cache
  Cache --> Report[Provenance and capability report]
  Report --> Execute[Launch selected harness]

  subgraph Repository [Versioned repository]
    Canonical[.rosettai canonical resources]
  end
  Canonical --> Locate

  subgraph Local [Ignored local state]
    Cache
    Report
  end
